Dwayne-McDaniel.com and that's got all my links.

609
00:50:50,240 --> 00:50:56,430
GitGuardian.com is my place of employment and I write a lot on our blog.

610
00:50:56,430 --> 00:51:05,390
So if you go to blog.gitguardian.com, you will see my face or maybe not immediately my face but you'll see my name associated with a good number of articles.

611
00:51:05,390 --> 00:51:07,351
I write a lot of recaps for events. I go to a lot of events.

612
00:51:07,351 --> 00:51:10,390
So if you're in North America, primarily I go to North America.

613
00:51:10,390 --> 00:51:16,631
Maybe I'll see you at a B-Sides or a DevOps Days or RSA or Identiverse or Def Con. I get around.

614
